    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Inception is time boxed product envisioning workshop to capture software requirements, build backlog, prioritize, and, come up with the minimum viable product, to help create a release &amp; rollout plan.</p><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Stationary to carry</span></h3><div class=\"h7\"><div class=\"Bk\"><div class=\"G3 G2\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><div><div class=\"adn ads\"><div class=\"gs\" style=\"margin-left: 44.0px;\"><div class=\"ii gt m14c3602e5b022750 adP adO\"><div class=\"a3s\"><div><ul><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Flip-chart paper pad or sticky-backed giant post-it note pad - 1 (10 pages at least)</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Calendar - 1</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Black Sharpies/Sketch-pen - 5&nbsp;</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Coloured Sharpies/Sketch-pen - 5</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Black White board markers - 2</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Coloured White board markers - 3</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">White board eraser - &nbsp;1</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Paper pads - 5</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Pens - 10</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Blue tack glue -1</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Post-it notes, various sizes, colours - &nbsp;5</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">White coloured index cards - 4&quot; x 6&rdquo; dimension - 2 packs(50 each)</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Coloured index cards - 4&quot; x 6&quot; dimension - 2 packs(50 each)<br /><br /></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"kv\"><div class=\"Bk\"><div class=\"G3 G2\" style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\"><div class=\"adf ads\"><h3 class=\"aju\">Useful articles on Inception Workshop</h3><ul><li><a href=\"http://www.slideshare.net/JennyWong8/inception-workshop-kickstarting-an-agile-workshop-30772352\">http://www.slideshare.net/JennyWong8/inception-workshop-kickstarting-an-agile-workshop-30772352</a></li><li><a href=\"https://agilewarrior.wordpress.com/2010/11/06/the-agile-inception-deck/\">https://agilewarrior.wordpress.com/2010/11/06/the-agile-inception-deck/</a></li><li><a href=\"http://www.sunitparekh.in/posts/process-timeline-map\">http://www.sunitparekh.in/posts/process-timeline-map</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.thoughtworks.com/insights/blog/story-mapping-visual-way-building-product-backlog\">https://www.thoughtworks.com/insights/blog/story-mapping-visual-way-building-product-backlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.quora.com/What-does-a-Thoughtworks-Inception-Workshop-look-like\">https://www.quora.com/What-does-a-Thoughtworks-Inception-Workshop-look-like</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.thoughtworks.com/insights/blog/7-tips-effective-inceptions\">https://www.thoughtworks.com/insights/blog/7-tips-effective-inceptions</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div>",
