    "view": {
      "value": "<p>Inception is time boxed product envisioning workshop to capture software requirements, build backlog, prioritize, and, come up with the minimum viable product, to help create a release &amp; rollout plan.</p><h3 id=\"PreparationforBahmniinception-Stationarytocarry\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Stationary to carry</span></h3><div class=\"h7\"><div class=\"Bk\"><div style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\" class=\"G3 G2\"><div><div class=\"adn ads\"><div style=\"margin-left: 44.0px;\" class=\"gs\"><div class=\"ii gt m14c3602e5b022750 adP adO\"><div class=\"a3s\"><div><ul><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Flip-chart paper pad or sticky-backed giant post-it note pad - 1 (10 pages at least)</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Calendar - 1</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Black Sharpies/Sketch-pen - 5 </li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Coloured Sharpies/Sketch-pen - 5</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Black White board markers - 2</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Coloured White board markers - 3</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">White board eraser -  1</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Paper pads - 5</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Pens - 10</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Blue tack glue -1</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Post-it notes, various sizes, colours -  5</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">White coloured index cards - 4&quot; x 6” dimension - 2 packs(50 each)</li><li style=\"margin-left: 15.0px;\">Coloured index cards - 4&quot; x 6&quot; dimension - 2 packs(50 each)<br/><br/></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"kv\"><div class=\"Bk\"><div style=\"margin-left: 0.0px;\" class=\"G3 G2\"><div class=\"adf ads\"><h3 class=\"aju\" id=\"PreparationforBahmniinception-UsefularticlesonInceptionWorkshop\">Useful articles on Inception Workshop</h3><ul><li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"http://www.slideshare.net/JennyWong8/inception-workshop-kickstartin